{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601120/extras/logo_01.gif?t=1744204672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for an adorable adventure in this cozy casual game, where hundreds of levels filled with cute cats await! Match fluffy kittens of different breeds, unlock their funny animations, and enjoy relaxing gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601120/extras/cat_01.gif?t=1744204672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">900+ levels with gradually increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 20 types of cats \u2014 from playful gingers to dignified British shorthairs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy visuals and soothing music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for players of all ages \u2014 bring joy and positivity to yourself and your loved ones!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601120?t=1744204672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601120/8fac73c188110c2be1d7c378416f4fc5adec5e26/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744204672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601120/36b1c9cd79596335c8294ac406a74177798ee148/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744204672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601120/36b1c9cd79596335c8294ac406a74177798ee148/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744204672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/